    "body": "Regarding the question of which issues in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4184#issuecomment-1072536425 should be considered blocking for writing up a spec of https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/dialog--initial-focus,-a-proposal#initial-dialog-focus-logic : I don't think this is blocking. Modeless dialogs are challenging, but giving them the same focus semantics as modal dialogs seems like a reasonable starting point. (Plus maybe the mentioned additional ability of `dialog.show({ preventInitialFocus: true })`.)",
