    "updated_at": "2022-08-25T21:11:31Z",
    "body": "Would it be helpful if I added a console message when dialog.show() is called saying that we are planning to remove it and to come here if you'd like it to stay...?\r\n\r\nThe only reason I don't want to remove it is because it's extra work for me when websites break, but if the use counter is truly below the accepted threshold or whatever then maybe it would be easy to remove.",
