    "created_at": "2022-09-08T19:56:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-09-08T19:56:19Z",
    "body": "`preventInitialFocus` may not be as necessary anymore if a modeless dialog could be opened as a `popup=manual`.  If specified as that and using `showPopUp()` to open, focus wouldn't go to the dialog by default then.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
